Type: Two-handed
Requires:
 6 Strength

Weight: 3"

	SAY NAME2 "Taralash +3"
	SAY DESC "Taralash is an ancient longbow, its origins lost to time but its craftsmanship speaks of masters long dead. The bow's limbs seem to shimmer with an otherworldly magic, as if the air around it moves more slowly. Warriors who have wielded it speak of arrows that seem to lag in the air, their paths crossing the battlefield with an eerie deliberateness that leaves foes struggling to react.

This weapon was further enhanced with the legendary Bowstring of Gond to grant the wielder Free Action, allowing them to act unimpeded by paralysis or movement-impairing effects.

STATISTICS:

